==============================================================================
EDUCATIONAL DEMONSTRATION ONLY
==============================================================================

Art Loupe is a portfolio / capstone demonstration of multi-agent reasoning
patterns applied to art critique and studio planning. It is NOT a valuation,
authentication, provenance, or legal service, and MUST NOT be relied on for any
appraisal, attribution, sale, insurance, or licensing decision.

  - Critique output is machine-generated analysis, not the opinion of a
    qualified art historian, appraiser, or conservator.
  - Art-historical context is drawn from public-domain and open-access museum
    collections and may be incomplete, out of date, or wrongly matched.
  - The system does NOT generate imagery. It analyses work the artist supplies
    and returns text, deterministic colour and edge analysis, and citations.
  - Uploaded work is the artist's own. Art Loupe claims no rights in it and does
    not use it to train models.
  - The software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. The authors
    accept no liability for any use — see the disclaimer of warranty and
    limitation of liability in the LICENSE.

